The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.

Short description
-----------------

generalized_newtonian1

 Generalized Newtonian problem on a unit square.
 Periodical boundary conditions.
 Poiseuille flow. Collocation of nodes.
 Picard iteration.
 Similar to the generalized_stokes3 example, but now using the
 generalized newtonian elements instead of the generalized stokes elements.

generalized_newtonian2

 Generalized Newtonian problem on a unit square.
 Periodical boundary conditions.
 Poiseuille flow. Collocation of nodes.
 Similar to generalized_newtonian1 but now Newton-Raphson iteration 
 instead of Picard iteration.

generalized_newtonian3

 Generalized Newtonian problem with yield on a unit square.
 Periodical boundary conditions.
 Poiseuille flow. Collocation of nodes.
 Picard iteration.
 Similar to the generalized_stokes4 example, but now using the
 generalized newtonian elements instead of the generalized stokes elements.

generalized_newtonian4

 Generalized Newtonian problem with yield on a unit square.
 Periodical boundary conditions.
 Poiseuille flow. Collocation of nodes.
 Similar to generalized_newtonian3 but now using a Newton-Raphson iteration
 preceeded by a number of Picard iterations.

